@id: cap:fast-cache-sla
@stratum: L3
@tag: read_query
@substrate: DBTable:todos, Budget:Latency25ms

Capability: Sub-25ms Read Latency SLA via Write-Through Memory Cache
  Quantifier: For ANY feature that performs a read_query on DBTable:todos, serve results from an in-memory read cache under 25ms p99.

  Scenario: Cached task list retrieval
    Given a user's todo list has been queried once
    When subsequent list queries arrive without intervening mutations
    Then the response is served directly from the in-memory read cache
